                        "entry_id": "61c39cab-1d9d-3270-9840-edf95f6729b1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui n’est pas attrayant."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7c67e680-d0a3-45c6-896b-03bea1099a16",
                                "sense_id": "705bdaad-c9e0-38c7-a351-6f006e159ec0",
                                "text": "Les marchandises sont, à bien peu près, rebutantes. On pourrait croire, même, que, pour modérer les appétits, étoffes, objets, etc… ^([sic : etc.]), se fassent inattrayants au possible, de sorte qu’on achèterait par grand besoin mais non jamais par gourmandise."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fcc0189c-75df-4cb1-b4ca-93cc8dbd82ba",
                        "source_entry_id": "61c39cab-1d9d-3270-9840-edf95f6729b1",
                        "source_sense_id": "705bdaad-c9e0-38c7-a351-6f006e159ec0",
                        "target_lang_word": "unattractive",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unattractive",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "66dc162c-1730-3019-bbe3-7b420579c1e3",
                                        "entry_id": "867ada71-50e5-3d9f-8b33-90a272d89e0a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not handsome or beautiful or appealing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b9c2b9ee-4df8-40b3-bc19-850e0dd83989",
                                                "sense_id": "66dc162c-1730-3019-bbe3-7b420579c1e3",
                                                "text": "All three parallel valleys of the Llynvi, Garw and Ogmore are much the same in physical character: the lower reaches are wooded and not unattractive, but as the railway climbs on ever-steepening grades, the hills on either hand grow barer and closer together, while in all respects the scene becomes more sombre, with the terraced, slate-roofed colliery towns and the road, railway and river all struggling for space in the narrowing defiles."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3e5cee9f-ab47-3fbe-94ee-6cbb7922de67",
                                        "entry_id": "867ada71-50e5-3d9f-8b33-90a272d89e0a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Lacking the power to attract interest."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f03296e-c431-43d3-87dd-b1879a4b614e",
                                                "sense_id": "3e5cee9f-ab47-3fbe-94ee-6cbb7922de67",
                                                "text": "Investors face a quandary. Cash offers a return of virtually zero in many developed countries; government-bond yields may have risen in recent weeks but they are still unattractive. Equities have suffered two big bear markets since 2000 and are wobbling again. It is hardly surprising that pension funds, insurers and endowments are searching for new sources of return."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d5bc3f6-ad1f-4f3d-9687-364b791ce5b3",
                                                "sense_id": "3e5cee9f-ab47-3fbe-94ee-6cbb7922de67",
                                                "text": "In Britain, nearly 2,500 steam locomotives were built, 999 to new designs. Although the latter were modern, they were still labour-intensive to man and maintain, during a period of full employment when working for poor pay in the dirty railway environment was unattractive."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "461c4015-49db-46ee-be99-b5631884d679",
                                                "sense_id": "3e5cee9f-ab47-3fbe-94ee-6cbb7922de67",
                                                "text": "In light of the similarities of this word to siṡáya etc. and their close semantic proximity, it is unattractive to separate these two words."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
